knows that from an early age, but what

00:19:37.005 --> 00:19:42.945
H₂O means is that each molecule of water
consists of two hydrogens and one oxygen.

00:19:43.515 --> 00:19:48.015
Now, the physical arrangement of those
two hydrogens and one oxygen turns out

00:19:48.015 --> 00:19:51.885
to be really important for how water
functions in the body, and frankly,

00:19:51.915 --> 00:19:57.705
elsewhere in our world and life, if
