00:20:33.719 --> 00:20:35.459
down are going to represent the oxygen.

00:20:35.699 --> 00:20:36.199
Okay?

00:20:36.360 --> 00:20:39.600
Now, what's important about
that visual impression or visual

00:20:39.600 --> 00:20:44.310
image of the individual water
molecule is that it is polarized.

00:20:44.729 --> 00:20:47.129
That is the hydrogen's over on one side.

00:20:47.520 --> 00:20:51.060
Both of them are over on one side
and the oxygen is over on another.

00:20:51.449 --> 00:20:55.649
And what's really important about
water molecules being polarized is

00:20:55.649 --> 00:20:58.500
that they can bind to one another
by way of that polarization.

00:20:58.500 --> 00:21:01.469
And this has to do with something that
