00:28:39.540 --> 00:28:42.419
It's a heavily debated topic as
to whether or not structured water

00:28:42.419 --> 00:28:45.449
is somehow better for ourselves
if it exists within our bodies.

00:28:45.540 --> 00:28:48.000
We'll get into that in full detail later.

00:28:48.149 --> 00:28:51.899
But the whole notion of structured
water is that in the presence of

00:28:51.899 --> 00:28:56.219
certain solids or certain liquids, the
confirmation of water that is the water

00:28:56.219 --> 00:28:58.260
molecules actually change somewhat.

00:28:58.260 --> 00:28:59.429
This has been demonstrated.

00:28:59.435 --> 00:29:01.500
Whether or not it has relevance
to the biological function of

00:29:01.500 --> 00:29:02.879
our body is a different issue.

00:29:02.885 --> 00:29:06.389
But we know that there is this fourth
phase of water called structured water.

00:29:06.830 --> 00:29:11.040
Structured water is a fairly complicated
topic, but we can make it very simple

00:29:11.040 --> 00:29:12.600
for sake of today's discussion.

00:29:12.959 --> 00:29:18.031
I mentioned earlier that opposite
polls attract that is positives and

00:29:18.350 --> 00:29:21.510
negatives attract, and typically,
things that are negatively charged

00:29:21.600 --> 00:29:24.960
when presented with another negative
charge either repel or don't attract.

00:29:25.200 --> 00:29:27.420
Things that are positively
charged in the presence of another

00:29:27.870 --> 00:29:29.430
positive charge also tend to repel.

00:29:29.430 --> 00:29:33.240
This is the basis of magnets,
either sticking to one another

00:29:33.240 --> 00:29:34.390
or repelling from one another.

00:29:34.880 --> 00:29:37.290
There's also the idea that human
beings who are opposites attract,

00:29:37.290 --> 00:29:39.690
but that's a different episode
that we need to do in the future.

00:29:40.680 --> 00:29:45.690
The point here is that structured
water is a unique condition in which

00:29:46.110 --> 00:29:50.850
the local environment that these
water molecules happen to be in allows

00:29:51.590 --> 00:29:55.770
positive charges between different
water molecules to attract one another.

00:29:55.770 --> 00:29:59.191
So again, whereas normally it's
positive and negatives that

00:29:59.196 --> 00:30:02.820
attract in the configuration
that we call structured water.

00:30:04.570 --> 00:30:08.670
Positives and positives attract
and form bonds that are stronger

00:30:08.700 --> 00:30:12.120
than the typical bonds that would
be formed between water molecules.

00:30:12.600 --> 00:30:15.990
And just as it kind of prelude to our
discussion about structured water,

00:30:15.995 --> 00:30:20.160
as it may or may not relate to health
later, there are a number of people that

00:30:20.160 --> 00:30:24.900
believe that within the body, because
of the presence of certain liquids

00:30:24.900 --> 00:30:29.430
and solids, that the water within our
cells, and in particular within the

00:30:29.430 --> 00:30:33.040
interactions with so-called organelles,
organelles are things like mitochondria.

00:30:33.670 --> 00:30:35.640
The Golgi apparatus,
they have fancy names.

00:30:35.640 --> 00:30:38.520
These are, these are the things
within cells that allow cells to do

00:30:38.520 --> 00:30:41.940
everything from make proteins to traffic
proteins out to the surface of cells.

00:30:41.940 --> 00:30:44.250
Things like neurotransmitters
and receptors and so on.

00:30:44.730 --> 00:30:47.970
A lot of people who are interested
in structured water as it relates to

00:30:47.970 --> 00:30:52.560
biological function, have I hypothesized
or like to debate rather whether or not

00:30:52.560 --> 00:30:57.780
in the body water is not just present
in its liquid form or gaseous form.

00:30:58.200 --> 00:31:01.500
We know it's not present in its
solid form unless you gulp down

00:31:01.500 --> 00:31:02.700
some ice cubes, for instance.

00:31:03.030 --> 00:31:07.395
But, There is a cohort of people out
there, including some fairly accomplished

00:31:07.875 --> 00:31:13.485
scientists that believe that within the
body, the organelles of our cells act as

00:31:13.485 --> 00:31:17.955
a substrate for water to exist in this
fourth form, this structured water form.

00:31:18.075 --> 00:31:22.005
And that's led to this whole
niche industry of people,  who are

00:31:22.005 --> 00:31:25.920
proponents of consuming so-called
structured water, and  again, we'll

00:31:25.935 --> 00:31:27.015
get to that a little bit later.

00:31:27.165 --> 00:31:30.655
So now you know what individual water
molecules consist of when you hear H₂O

00:31:30.675 --> 00:31:34.485
hopefully you'll get that visual image
