00:31:34.485 --> 00:31:37.485
molecule being the peace symbol and a
bunch of those binding to one another

00:31:37.485 --> 00:31:41.085
through these relatively weak bonds,
but strong enough that certain things

00:31:41.090 --> 00:31:42.680
can take place like surface tension.

00:31:43.860 --> 00:31:46.935
Keep in mind that surface tension of
water may relate to either standard

00:31:46.935 --> 00:31:48.870
bonds between water or this fourth phase.

00:31:49.130 --> 00:31:54.075
That's heavily debated still, but we
certainly know that for instance, if

00:31:54.075 --> 00:31:57.435
you were to take a piece of wax paper
