00:38:24.945 --> 00:38:30.225
actually interact with the hydrogens
and oxygens of water and can change

00:38:30.525 --> 00:38:36.705
those salt molecules or sugar molecules,
turning them from solid into liquid.

00:38:37.155 --> 00:38:42.055
Essentially creating what are called
solids, which is basically  the dissolving

