01:29:45.030 --> 01:29:50.700
in tap water in different regions, not
just in the US but around the world, I

01:29:50.700 --> 01:29:53.550
confess the picture is a pretty scary one.

01:29:53.850 --> 01:29:56.580
I want to be clear, I'm not somebody
who naturally orients towards

01:29:56.580 --> 01:29:58.170
fear or conspiracy theories.

