01:34:35.565 --> 01:34:39.555
But what you're really looking
for is whether or not there are

01:34:39.555 --> 01:34:44.445
high, low, or moderate levels of
fluoride in that drinking water.

01:34:44.505 --> 01:34:45.495
Why do I say that?

01:34:45.555 --> 01:34:51.105
Well, there are studies that show that
the concentration of fluoride in drinking

01:34:51.105 --> 01:34:56.265
water is of particular concern for the
thyroid hormone system of the body.

01:34:56.385 --> 01:34:59.025
Now, thyroid hormone has a lot
of different roles in brain and

01:34:59.025 --> 01:35:03.585
body, and thyroid hormone is very
important for everything from

01:35:03.585 --> 01:35:05.565
metabolism to levels of energy.

01:35:05.805 --> 01:35:09.375
When thyroid levels are disrupted
or thyroid receptors are disrupted,

01:35:09.375 --> 01:35:10.545
it can lead to depression.

01:35:10.785 --> 01:35:13.995
When thyroid hormones are
optimized, it can lead to optimal

01:35:14.055 --> 01:35:15.735
mood if there is such a thing.

01:35:15.735 --> 01:35:18.915
But in other words, it helps
keep your mood elevated.

01:35:19.125 --> 01:35:22.335
It relates to everything from sleep to
reproduction, thyroid hormones involved

01:35:22.335 --> 01:35:25.035
in many, many things including bone
health and tissue health generally.

01:35:25.035 --> 01:35:28.485
So essentially, every biological
process in your body is impacted by

01:35:28.635 --> 01:35:32.535
thyroid hormone, and there's a study
that I'd like to highlight, which was

01:35:32.535 --> 01:35:36.045
published in 2018, and the title of
the study is Impact of Drinking Water

01:35:36.045 --> 01:35:37.845
Fluoride on Human Thyroid Hormones.

01:35:38.025 --> 01:35:41.820
This was a case control study
so this is not an extensive

01:35:41.820 --> 01:35:43.140
analysis of many individuals.

01:35:43.140 --> 01:35:48.600
However, what it shows is that fluoride
negatively impacts thyroid stimulating

01:35:48.600 --> 01:35:50.670
hormone and so-called T3 levels.

01:35:50.700 --> 01:35:56.190
So you have thyroid hormone, T3, and T4
even in the standard concentrations that

01:35:56.190 --> 01:36:01.200
are present of, and here's an important
